# ODDLIGHT engine configuration example. Copy to .env (git-ignored). No variable is required for the zero-cost route.
# Never put API keys in project.json or customer.json — the engine refuses credential-like fields there.
#
# Optional local LLM (free, runs on your machine) for drafting — facts still require human review:
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
#
# Paid providers are NOT wired in. If one is ever added it must read its key from the environment
# and the project must explicitly allow spending with budget.max_paid_eur > 0.
